DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_A8CC_CC33';
<p>a8cc_cc33</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #646108;">Gene M</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #646108;"><i>mushy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #646108;">Gene M</span> feels soft to the touch and unusually squishy, unlike the usual firmness.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #086594;">Gene N</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #086594;"><i>nerdy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #086594;">Gene N</span> has large, prominent eyes that stand out, much like thick-rimmed glasses.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene P</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #8a378a;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, nerdy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">7,327</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">14,289</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">26,455</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">mushy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f1edba; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">m</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">42,164</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">41,172</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">26,847</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">14,317</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #646108;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">7,429</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">180,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>N</b> and <b>M</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>N</b> and <b>M</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_A8CC_CC33
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(41,172 + 42,164)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>83,336</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.4630 = <strong>46.30 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(7,327 + 14,289 + 26,455 + 26,847)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>74,918</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.4162 = <strong>41.62 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(7,327 + 7,429 + 14,289 + 14,317)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>43,362</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.2409 = <strong>24.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(7,327 + 7,429 + 14,289 + 26,455)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>55,500</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.3083 = <strong>30.83 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(7,327 + 7,429 + 26,847 + 41,172)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>82,775</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.4599 = <strong>45.99 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(7,429 + 14,317 + 26,847 + 42,164)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>90,757</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.5042 = <strong>50.42 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(7,327 + 7,429 + 14,289 + 14,317)</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = <sup>43,362</sup>/<sub>180,000</sub> = 0.2409 = <strong>24.09 cM</strong>
LITERAL_A8CC_CC33_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
